        <div class="value-card rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-7 dark:border-white/10 dark:bg-slate-900">
          <div class="mb-3 text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-amber-700">MARKET FIT</div>
          <div class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Phoenix / Scottsdale luxury</div>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
            The Valley is home to high-net-worth residents, strong medical aesthetics demand, resort visitors, and a growing appetite for premium skincare, injectables, and wellness experiences.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="value-card rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-7 dark:border-white/10 dark:bg-slate-900">
          <div class="mb-3 text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-amber-700">FUTURE-PROOF</div>
          <div class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Purpose-built .beauty TLD</div>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
