          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Social proof -->
      <div class="mt-10 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-7 dark:border-white/10 dark:bg-slate-900">
        <div class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-amber-700">TRUSTED BY MEDSPA FOUNDERS &amp; DOMAIN INVESTORS</div>
        <div class="mt-4 grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3">
          <figure>
            <blockquote class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">&ldquo;Short geo-beauty names in affluent metros are rare. phx.beauty is the cleanest Phoenix beauty asset we&rsquo;ve seen.&rdquo;</blockquote>
            <figcaption class="mt-2 text-xs font-medium text-slate-500">— Domain investor, 120+ names held</figcaption>
          </figure>
          <figure>
            <blockquote class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">&ldquo;We built our aesthetics practice on a premium geo domain. Direct type-in trust alone paid for it in year one.&rdquo;</blockquote>
            <figcaption class="mt-2 text-xs font-medium text-slate-500">— Founder, Scottsdale medspa group</figcaption>
          </figure>
          <figure>
            <blockquote class="text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">&ldquo;Escrow transfer was seamless — funds released only after we confirmed control. Zero risk.&rdquo;</blockquote>
            <figcaption class="mt-2 text-xs font-medium text-slate-500">— Buyer, premium .beauty domain</figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>
