        </div>

        <div class="grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
          <div class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-7 dark:border-white/10 dark:bg-slate-950">
            <div class="mb-4 text-3xl" aria-hidden="true">♥</div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Luxury Medspa or Aesthetics Clinic</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Flagship domain for a high-end medspa in Scottsdale, Paradise Valley, Arcadia, or North Phoenix offering Botox, fillers, lasers, and advanced treatments.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-7 dark:border-white/10 dark:bg-slate-950">
            <div class="mb-4 text-3xl" aria-hidden="true">✦</div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Premium Skincare Brand</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Launch or elevate a luxury skincare, cosmeceutical, or clean beauty line with strong local Phoenix roots and national expansion potential.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-7 dark:border-white/10 dark:bg-slate-950">
            <div class="mb-4 text-3xl" aria-hidden="true">♣</div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Full-Service Beauty Destination</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Ideal for an integrated luxury beauty concept combining medspa services, hair, skincare, and wellness under one premium brand.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-7 dark:border-white/10 dark:bg-slate-950">
            <div class="mb-4 text-3xl" aria-hidden="true">★</div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Wellness &amp; Longevity Clinic</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Perfect for hormone optimization, IV therapy, peptide, or longevity-focused beauty &amp; wellness practices targeting the active 55+ and high-performance communities.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-7 dark:border-white/10 dark:bg-slate-950">
            <div class="mb-4 text-3xl" aria-hidden="true">♦</div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Resort or Hospitality Beauty Concept</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Pair with a luxury resort, private club, or high-end hospitality group for an exclusive on-site or branded beauty experience in the Valley.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-7 dark:border-white/10 dark:bg-slate-950">
            <div class="mb-4 text-3xl" aria-hidden="true">♠</div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Multi-Location Beauty Group</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">Scalable brand for a growing network of salons, medspas, or aesthetics locations across Phoenix, Scottsdale, and the East/West Valley.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- MARKET -->
    <section class="reveal mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-16" id="market" aria-labelledby="market-heading">
      <div class="grid items-center gap-x-12 md:grid-cols-12">
        <div class="md:col-span-7">
          <div class="mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[2px] text-amber-700">The Market</div>
          <h2 id="market-heading" class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tighter text-slate-900 md:text-4xl dark:text-white">
            Phoenix &amp; Scottsdale represent one of the strongest luxury beauty markets in the Southwest.
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-5 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300">
            With a large affluent population, strong medical aesthetics demand, year-round resort and golf visitors,
            a vibrant 55+ active adult community, and growing interest in longevity and wellness, the Valley continues
            to support premium beauty and self-care concepts at a high level.
          </p>
          <div class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-3 gap-6 text-sm">
