            <div>
              <div class="font-mono text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tighter text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Growing</div>
              <div class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-500">longevity &amp; aesthetic<br />medicine interest</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-xs text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
            Sources: U.S. Census Bureau, American Med Spa Association state reports, and Phoenix/Scottsdale economic development data. Figures are approximate and subject to change.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-10 md:col-span-5 md:mt-0">
          <div class="fact-card rounded-3xl bg-slate-900 p-8 text-sm text-white dark:bg-black dark:border dark:border-white/10">
            <div class="mb-5 text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-white/50">KEY ADVANTAGES OF phx.beauty</div>
            <ul class="space-y-4 text-white/90">
              <li class="flex gap-x-3"><span class="mt-1 text-amber-400">→</span> Short, premium, and instantly brandable</li>
              <li class="flex gap-x-3"><span class="mt-1 text-amber-400">→</span> Clear Phoenix / Scottsdale geo relevance</li>
